  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance access to lifesaving health care services and emergency obstetric and newborn health for IDPs and host communities in the Jarablus- Jarablus and Millis-Salqin districts of North Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRD is proposing to enhance access to lifesaving, integrated health services through the provision of Primary health care services, Basic Reproductive health services and Mental Health Services, through directly operating two BEmONC facilities.Main goal: Provide timely and quality Integrated Primary Health Care and Basic Emergency Obstetric Care to pregnant women and new mothers along with management of Non Communicable disease and Mental Health services in order to reduce mortality and morbidity among targeted beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
